%% id: pattern-scale-to-zero · level: pattern · visibility: public · owner: architect
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as First visitor
  participant D as Door service<br/>always on, 1 replica
  participant W as Waker<br/>autoscaler trigger
  participant E as Environment<br/>scaled to zero
  participant S as Shared services<br/>kept warm while anything is awake
  participant Z as Idle sleeper<br/>cron
  V->>D: request
  D-->>V: holding page: "waking, 2–5 min"
  D->>W: wake signal
  W->>S: ensure warm
  W->>E: scale to 1
  E-->>D: healthy
  V->>D: refresh
  D->>E: proxy
  E-->>V: page
  Note over Z,E: quiet for N minutes
  Z->>E: scale to 0
  Z->>S: release keepalive
